# The image serves a copy of this repository (/app/repo) for the demo's
# "Conduit itself" tab, so the build context is the repo as committed. Render
# builds from a fresh clone, which holds tracked files only; these lines keep a
# local build just as clean.
#
# Root-only entries start with "/", which Docker and git read the same way. A
# bare ".env" would also drop sample-repo/.env, the fake secret the demo's
# deny-list is there to refuse.
.git/
/.venv/
/venv/
/.env
/.env.*
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
/.kilo/
/.kilocode/
/.learn/
/brag-output*/
node_modules/
/CONDUIT_BUILD_PLAN.md
/docs/resume-bullet.md
/docs/loom-script.md
